Game Copyright Notice (Saints Row Series)
----------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is an independent, fan-made Chinese localization ("translation
patch") for the Saints Row video game series. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by the copyright holders of those games.

Saints Row and all related titles, characters, artwork, music, and trademarks
are the property of their respective copyright holders, including but not
limited to:

    - THQ (2006-2012)
    - Volition, Inc. (original developer)
    - Deep Silver (2013-present)

Copyright (c) their respective owners. All rights reserved.

This project distributes NO copyrighted game assets. It provides only
translation text and data that users must apply to their own legally
acquired copies of the games. The games themselves are not redistributed
by this project and remain governed by their own licenses and copyright.

